menu "Caipo BLE link"

    config CAIPO_BLE_ENABLED
        bool "Start the BLE link at boot"
        default y
        help
            Off: ble_link_init() returns ESP_ERR_NOT_SUPPORTED without
            touching the controller and the rest of the firmware runs
            without the app link. Used by sdkconfig.wokwi, because Wokwi
            does not simulate Bluetooth. Leave on for real hardware.

    config CAIPO_BLE_NAME_PREFIX
        string "Advertised name prefix"
        default "CAIPO"
        help
            The device advertises this prefix followed by four hex digits
            of its address, e.g. CAIPO3F2A. The app discovers by service
            UUID and shows this name. Agreed contract: "CAIPO", no dash.

    config CAIPO_BLE_HEARTBEAT_MS
        int "Heartbeat interval (ms)"
        range 200 5000
        default 1000
        help
            Period of the [0x10][counter] notification on the control
            characteristic once the link is encrypted and subscribed.
            Contract (R01.4): 1000 ms; the app treats 3 s of silence as
            disconnected.

    config CAIPO_BLE_SUPERVISION_TIMEOUT_MS
        int "Requested supervision timeout (ms)"
        range 1000 32000
        default 6000
        help
            Requested from the central right after connecting. The central
            may refuse or change it. Contract: 6000 ms.

    config CAIPO_BLE_CONN_ITVL_MIN_MS
        int "Requested connection interval min (ms)"
        range 8 4000
        default 15

    config CAIPO_BLE_CONN_ITVL_MAX_MS
        int "Requested connection interval max (ms)"
        range 8 4000
        default 30
        help
            Apple accessory guidelines: min >= 15 ms, max >= min + 15 ms,
            max * (latency + 1) * 3 <= supervision timeout.

endmenu
